              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dimension+of+a+vector+space"} dimension
              of the group algebra equals that of the right hand side, hence that
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
