                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} R[A]
              is an
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/integral+domain"} integral domain
              iff
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi R
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} R
              is an integral domain and
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi A
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A
              is
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/torsion-free"} torsion-free
          %h3#OfCentralExtensionsAndTwistedGroupAlgebras Of central extensions &amp; Twisted group algebras
          %p
            A
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quotient+algebra"} quotient algebra
            of the group algebra of a
